<title>俄罗斯西伯利亚鼠疫研究所一名实验室工作人员近期因患不明原因肺炎死亡。当局已隔离数十人，表示情况已得到控制，未出现新增病例</title>
<link>https://t.me/tnews365/35654</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/tnews365/35654</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 16:06:51 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto">俄罗斯西伯利亚鼠疫研究所一名实验室工作人员近期因患不明原因肺炎死亡。当局已隔离数十人，表示情况已得到控制，未出现新增病例。<br/>未经证实的报道称，死者可能死于<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%82%BA%E9%BC%A0%E7%96%AB" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">肺鼠疫</a>。而肺鼠疫可通过人与人接触传播。但当局表示，广泛的检测未发现与死者职业活动相关的微生物。<br/>还有未经证实的报道称，死者曾打翻装有活细菌的试管。但当局表示，未发现任何与处理病原体有关的事故证据。<br/>（<a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/healthcare-pharmaceuticals/dozens-quarantined-siberia-after-plague-institute-lab-worker-dies-2026-10-05/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">路透社</a>，<a href="https://apnews.com/article/russia-disease-plague-researcher-pneumonia-9ddc8e3e064637853407bfd24d8937f5" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">美联社</a>，<a href="https://www.dailymail.com/news/article-16183277/Russias-plague-zone-Map-shows-areas-initiated-lockdowns-scientist-killed-countries-tighten-border-health-controls.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">每日邮报</a>）</div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/E0qJnAsRu3P9WXAB57o06VMdXJlG47HB0oB5atdhVxIWMe0fCYVu240IhdZdL2cuqJ5gRNFj3hNC1s5TUDkqw6a20RBA2Qj3H5nP62cejAtXjC50a27jp5RksWxh7EdYWQUKUekeb0VhRvL3B5bpfGozq0vWPmkvl0CAWqzRqTS_LHaynSzNz-lZvUbK39aIXsAccoAXck6WApftw5Mp_vuII_XKNooJFx_g7f-twcMVY1xUcQHkWSQD2-sjdzlKVOZ495-RK82H7xWAs__zOKgcS7PQU2olWv0JjrHR6FKdPNh0yehjpikiIe7ZbUU9o6BdqmCYYQGXemQU8lW25Q.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/YmAoQkpOeAhq5Eak3nDjnHa68Y8xIggiw-SRCvrhz-Yzzx2yfFpROv-2dqaYVZRvnCRZ9xuDCsjZF9exB6lI807JKrGCvx-OWbF076Rvg3p8hdaBvzb5D1816JYQhT35n-ShtyNlLaYSH3EdpYGJ94sOAmJ5UhQlRZOMzz_YnL-dvJ47OHl1TziS5zOpvaHS2JM8HGtTEVIASN4r3OBNBED13bHnSb692ABd6L3atho6YzHS6MGOAaihs7Aqb4Vae0jzX06a8Jev_UKfpWTpvSmj3j3xxfdsB4yZOTeAJJd6w0